## Recommended Next Steps

1. Prove the two obstruction lemmas above in the finite-grid Bayes-value language.
2. Try a noisy common-parameter construction and explicitly compute the revenue gap versus KL/TV.
3. If the information-gap tradeoff is real, pivot: the current truncation upper bound may be loose for power-tail classes, and a variance/tail-sensitive upper bound may be the right target.
